\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Forget them not, O Christ, who stand
\par Thy vanguard in the distant land.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. In food, in flame, in dark, in dread,
\par Sustain we pray, each lifted heard.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Exalt them over every fear,
\par In peril come Thyself more near.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thine is the work they strive to do,
\par Their foes so many, they so few.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Be with Thine own, Thy loved, who stand,
\par Christ's vanguard, in the stormswept land.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

